---
// Mass properties through the burn, as a picture. Top: the vehicle (payload, motor, nozzle) to scale along the axis,
// with its centre of gravity at ignition and at burnout and the moment arm from each to the nozzle pivot. Bottom: a
// section through a grain whose bore is off the axis (exaggerated), at ignition and when the web first burns through:
// the hole has grown, and the sliver that is left pulls the CG off the axis. Positions from the worked example.
const ink = 'var(--rd-ink)', muted = 'var(--rd-muted)', hot = 'var(--rd-accent)', blue = 'var(--rd-blue)';
const s = 0.249, X = (mm: number) => 14 + (mm + 320) * s; // mm along the axis, from the forward reference, to px
const ay = 70, Rp = 150 * s, rb = 50 * s; // axis, case and bore radii in px
const cgI = X(409.2), cgB = X(168.5), piv = X(1110);
const halo = { stroke: 'var(--rd-panel)', 'stroke-width': 4, 'paint-order': 'stroke', 'stroke-linejoin': 'round' };
// the CG symbol: a circle with two opposite quarters filled
const quarters = (cx: number, cy: number, r: number) =>
  `M${cx},${cy} L${cx + r},${cy} A${r} ${r} 0 0 1 ${cx},${cy + r} Z M${cx},${cy} L${cx - r},${cy} A${r} ${r} 0 0 1 ${cx},${cy - r} Z`;
const fwdDome = `M${X(75)},${ay - Rp} A${75 * s} ${Rp} 0 0 0 ${X(75)},${ay + Rp}`;
const aftDome = `M${X(1075)},${ay - Rp} A${75 * s} ${Rp} 0 0 1 ${X(1075)},${ay + Rp}`;
const cone = (k: number) => `M${X(1132)},${ay + k * 10} L${X(1160)},${ay + k * 5} L${X(1340)},${ay + k * 21}`;
// the sections: case radius 36 px, bore off the axis by 4 px (exaggerated)
const S1 = { x: 70, y: 212 }, S2 = { x: 186, y: 212 }, Rc = 36, e = 4;
---

<figure class="viz cgt">
  <p class="viz-title">The centre of gravity through the burn</p>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 440 266" role="img" aria-labelledby="cgt-desc" style="max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <desc id="cgt-desc">
      Top: a vehicle drawn along its axis: a payload at the front, then the motor case with its domes, the grain with a
      round bore, and the nozzle at the back. Two centre-of-gravity symbols on the axis show the vehicle at ignition
      and at burnout: at burnout it is further forward, toward the payload. Dimension lines below the motor show the
      moment arm from each centre of gravity to the nozzle pivot: the arm is longer at burnout. Bottom: two sections
      through a grain with its bore off the axis, exaggerated. At ignition the hole is small. When the web first burns
      through, the hole touches the case on one side, and a thin crescent of propellant is left on the other side,
      with its centre of gravity far off the axis.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="cgt-a" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill={muted}></path></marker>
      <marker id="cgt-b" viewBox="0 0 8 8" refX="7" refY="4" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" fill={hot}></path></marker>
    </defs>
    <!-- the vehicle -->
    <rect x={X(-320)} y={ay - 34} width={300 * s} height="68" rx="6" fill="var(--rd-steel)" fill-opacity="0.35" stroke={muted}></rect>
    <text x={X(-170)} y={ay + 4} text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill={ink}>payload</text>
    <rect x={X(75)} y={ay - Rp + 1.5} width={1000 * s} height={Rp - rb - 1.5} fill="var(--rd-propellant)" fill-opacity="0.35"></rect>
    <rect x={X(75)} y={ay + rb} width={1000 * s} height={Rp - rb - 1.5} fill="var(--rd-propellant)" fill-opacity="0.35"></rect>
    <path d={fwdDome} fill="none" stroke={ink} stroke-width="2.2"></path>
    <path d={aftDome} fill="none" stroke={ink} stroke-width="2.2"></path>
    <line x1={X(75)} y1={ay - Rp} x2={X(1075)} y2={ay - Rp} stroke={ink} stroke-width="2.2"></line>
    <line x1={X(75)} y1={ay + Rp} x2={X(1075)} y2={ay + Rp} stroke={ink} stroke-width="2.2"></line>
    <path d={cone(-1)} fill="none" stroke={ink} stroke-width="2"></path>
    <path d={cone(1)} fill="none" stroke={ink} stroke-width="2"></path>
    <line x1={X(-330)} y1={ay} x2={X(1350)} y2={ay} stroke={muted} stroke-dasharray="8 3 2 3"></line>
    <circle cx={piv} cy={ay} r="3.5" fill="var(--rd-panel)" stroke={ink} stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
    <!-- the CG at ignition and at burnout -->
    <line x1={cgI} y1="26" x2={cgI} y2={ay - 8} stroke={hot} stroke-dasharray="2 2"></line>
    <line x1={cgB} y1="26" x2={cgB} y2={ay - 8} stroke={hot} stroke-dasharray="2 2"></line>
    <line x1={cgI - 2} y1="24" x2={cgB + 4} y2="24" stroke={hot} stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#cgt-b)"></line>
    <text x={cgI - 4} y="14" font-size="11" fill={hot}>CG at ignition</text>
    <text x={cgB + 2} y="14" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill={hot}>at burnout</text>
    {[cgI, cgB].map((cx, k) => (
      <>
        <circle cx={cx} cy={ay} r="6" fill="var(--rd-panel)" stroke={k ? hot : ink} stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
        <path d={quarters(cx, ay, 6)} fill={k ? hot : ink}></path>
      </>
    ))}
    <!-- the moment arms to the pivot -->
    {[cgB, cgI, piv].map((x) => <line x1={x} y1={ay + Rp + 3} x2={x} y2="146" stroke={muted}></line>)}
    <line x1={cgI} y1="124" x2={piv} y2="124" stroke={muted} marker-start="url(#cgt-a)" marker-end="url(#cgt-a)"></line>
    <line x1={cgB} y1="141" x2={piv} y2="141" stroke={muted} marker-start="url(#cgt-a)" marker-end="url(#cgt-a)"></line>
    <text x={(cgI + piv) / 2} y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill={ink}>arm at ignition</text>
    <text x={(cgB + piv) / 2 + 30} y="137" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill={ink}>arm at burnout: longer</text>
    <text x={piv} y="157" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill={muted}>nozzle pivot</text>
    <!-- a bore off the axis -->
    <text x="8" y="168" font-size="11" fill={ink}>a bore off the axis, exaggerated:</text>
    <circle cx={S1.x} cy={S1.y} r={Rc} fill="var(--rd-propellant)" fill-opacity="0.35" stroke={ink} stroke-width="2"></circle>
    <circle cx={S1.x + e} cy={S1.y} r="12" fill="var(--rd-panel)" stroke={ink} stroke-width="1.2"></circle>
    <circle cx={S2.x} cy={S2.y} r={Rc} fill="var(--rd-propellant)" fill-opacity="0.35" stroke={ink} stroke-width="2"></circle>
    <circle cx={S2.x + e} cy={S2.y} r={Rc - e} fill="var(--rd-panel)" stroke={ink} stroke-width="1.2"></circle>
    <line x1={S1.x - Rc - 4} y1={S1.y} x2={S2.x + Rc + 4} y2={S2.y} stroke={muted} stroke-dasharray="8 3 2 3"></line>
    <circle cx={S2.x - Rc / 2} cy={S2.y} r="4.5" fill="var(--rd-panel)" stroke={hot} stroke-width="1.4"></circle>
    <path d={quarters(S2.x - Rc / 2, S2.y, 4.5)} fill={hot}></path>
    <line x1="141" y1="230" x2="152" y2="226" stroke={muted}></line>
    <text x="139" y="236" text-anchor="end" font-size="10" fill={ink} {...halo}>sliver</text>
    <text x={S1.x} y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill={ink}>at ignition</text>
    <text x={S2.x} y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill={ink}>web burnout</text>
    <text x="242" y="196" font-size="11" fill={muted}>The hole grows and the</text>
    <text x="242" y="211" font-size="11" fill={muted}>mass falls: the CG moves</text>
    <text x="242" y="226" font-size="11" fill={muted}>off the axis, most when</text>
    <text x="242" y="241" font-size="11" fill={muted}>the web burns through.</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Top: the vehicle's centre of gravity moves forward as the aft propellant burns, so the arm to the nozzle pivot gets
    longer. The motor's own centre of gravity moves the other way, toward its nozzle. Bottom: a bore off the axis. The
    hole grows and the mass falls, so the centre of gravity moves off the axis; when the web first burns through, a
    crescent of propellant is left on one side. The offset is exaggerated.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
